Who are we looking for?&middot;        You are a reliable team player with a positive attitude&middot;        You are punctual and have a keen eye for detail&middot;        You enjoy working in a clean, organised environment&middot;        You are flexible and available for different shifts, including weekends and public holidays&middot;        You have a basic command of Dutch and/or English&middot;        Previous experience in a kitchen or stewarding role is welcome, but not essentialWhat do we offer?&middot;        A welcoming workplace within a diverse and international team&middot;        A dynamic hotel environment where teamwork and initiative are valued&middot;        Regular internal and external training and opportunities to grow within the hotel and Hilton&middot;        Access to Hilton's learning and development programmes&middot;

Are you someone who enjoys physical work and are you looking for a full-time position in day shift? Then we have a great opportunity for you! For Dorel Juvenile in Helmond, we are looking for a motivated Loader & Unloader who is ready to roll up their sleeves.Together with your colleagues, you will ensure that goods are processed correctly and efficiently. You will stay active throughout the day and play an important role in the logistics process.

What will you do?

- Loading and unloading trucks;
- Checking and processing incoming goods;
- Packing and preparing outgoing shipments for dispatch;
- Storing products in the correct warehouse locations;
- Assisting with stock counts and inventory management;
- Maintaining a neat, safe, and organized working environment.

- You speak Dutch or English;
- You are physically fit and enjoy active work;
- You can travel independently to Helmond;
- You are available for day shifts from 08:00 AM to 04:30 PM;
- Experience in logistics is a plus, but not required.

Are you looking for a logistics job in the Beringe, Panningen, Helden, Meijel, Maasbree, Sevenum, Horst, Venlo, Roermond or Weert area? Then this is your chance to work for one of the world’s largest logistics employers. 
Whether you have experience as a logistics assistant, warehouse assistant, order picker, warehouse employee or production worker, or are looking to take your first steps in the logistics sector, we’d be happy to explore the possibilities with you.

- Order picking using a hand-held scanner;
- Collecting and processing orders;
- Packing and preparing products for dispatch;
- Sorting goods;
- Checking incoming and outgoing consignments;
- Loading and unloading lorries;
- Ensuring a safe, clean and organised working environment.

- Speak Dutch, English or German;
- Be motivated to work in logistics;
- Be able to work both independently and as part of a team;
- Work accurately and responsibly;
- Be available for day shifts or three-shift rotas;
- Be willing to carry out physical work;
- Have your own transport and accommodation (per candidate);
- Some experience in logistics would be an advantage;
